type: software
title: "AC/DC OPF with RES-Side Privacy Preservation: Distributed vs. Projection Method"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB/YALMIP code comparing a distributed (ADMM) and a projection-based
  (epsilon-constrained method) approach to SOCP-relaxed AC/DC optimal power
  flow with renewable-energy-source-side privacy preservation, benchmarked
  against centralized optimization on a 9-bus AC / 5-terminal MTDC test system.
